    summary_60s: 'Pollution is the introduction of harmful substances (pollutants) into the environment, causing damage to living organisms, ecosystems, and human health. Pollutants can be chemicals (e.g., oil, pesticides), energy (e.g., noise, heat), or materials (e.g., plastic waste). Types of P',
